  "id": "target-behavior",
  "term": "target behavior",
  "definition": "Target behavior is the specific behavior chosen as the direct focus of a behavioral intervention or study. In this context, it is the behavior intentionally addressed, as distinct from later behaviors that may change indirectly as spillover effects.",
